{"3042650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Race Max Pro", "steam_appid": 3042650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4550040, 4550020, 4550030], "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Edition</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race Max Pro – Champion Edition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/a3dc86ee8a0eb7e23063770545bf444f.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=1114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your experience to the next level with the most complete Race Max Pro bundle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Champion Edition unlocks powerful gameplay advantages, premium customization features, and a top-tier lineup of cars — giving you everything you need to dominate across Street, Drift, and Drag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Champion Edition Includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited Fuel for uninterrupted racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-Stop Events access to maximize rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Forever to remove all upgrade cooldowns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7200 Gold + Premium Packs for faster progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIP Pack Benefits:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VIP Badge &amp; Frame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock All Decal Slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock All Color Options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+15% Extra Cash Rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom License Plate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Username</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exclusive Content:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Decals &amp; Special Liveries</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car Bundles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Champion Car Bundle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pagani Utopia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMW M4 CSL</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ford Mustang Boss 302</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nissan Skyline GT-R R34</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUF SCR</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Car Bundle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nissan GT-R Nismo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aston Martin Vantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mazda RX-8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peugeot 308</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chevrolet Camaro</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starter Car Bundle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naran Hyper Coupe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jaguar XKR-S GT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peugeot 508</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nissan Silvia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AC Cobra</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock everything. Upgrade faster. Race without limits.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Race Max Pro is a fast, stylish arcade racing game that blends Street, Drift, and Drag into one skill-driven experience. Dominate short, high-intensity races with tight controls, deep tuning, and a garage full of real licensed cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/ff258b7909b3ba8fcb8fc29ea9e4173c.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Ways to Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master three distinct racing styles.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street tests your control and racecraft,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift rewards precision and flow,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag demands perfect timing and launch execution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between them instantly each mode sharpens a different skill and keeps every race fast and intense. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/6174400e0402e84cd7deb4761d650c9b.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/75565cd77137b21e7cd2050b8630e1f0.poster.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/75565cd77137b21e7cd2050b8630e1f0.webm?t=1776261198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/75565cd77137b21e7cd2050b8630e1f0.mp4?t=1776261198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single-Player Career</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb your way through a full single-player progression.</strong> Beat challenging opponents, earn better rewards, and unlock faster machines as you advance through each chapter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time-Limited Events </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into rotating time-limited events with unique goals and exclusive rewards. </strong>Test Drive, Weekly Events, Time Trial, Air Time, Speed Trap each one pushes a different skill and keeps the game fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete seasonal objectives to unlock limited-edition cars, cosmetics, and performance upgrades. </strong>New rewards arrive regularly, expanding your garage over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/e62d9baa56bfe09e0c59be2ae045e730.poster.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/e62d9baa56bfe09e0c59be2ae045e730.webm?t=1776261198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/e62d9baa56bfe09e0c59be2ae045e730.mp4?t=1776261198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/1ae737f2c99523cb034f660cc545e3bd.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/3477df25684e3d034e046b66fff2e6fd.poster.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/3477df25684e3d034e046b66fff2e6fd.webm?t=1776261198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/3477df25684e3d034e046b66fff2e6fd.mp4?t=1776261198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Tuning System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build performance your way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade engine, turbo, gearbox, nitro, tires, and more then fine-tune each setup to match Street, Drift, or Dr