 ><strong>Style your car with full visual freedom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change paint, wraps, rims, spoilers, and more to create a look that matches your racing identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/51dbf49d81ce0a6c28a0ace3f8b09131.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=253 /></span><strong>Legendary Cars</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race with officially licensed icons from BMW, Ford, Nissan, Pagani, Jaguar, Audi, Lotus, Aston Martin, Mazda, Volkswagen, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each car is recreated with attention to handling, sound, and performance so every machine feels distinct on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/6177392ea94c212d8788ad6b0fd83876.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer League Mod</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete in online leagues built for fast, skill-based races.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb divisions, earn rewards, and face tougher opponents as you rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge Friends Mode </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race head-to-head with friends or rivals in custom matchups.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick to set up, easy to repeat pure arcade competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/27ac5a7f62bc0cd32f4a4686896c9ae3.avif?t=1776261198\" width=780 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.stea